{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>For</b> — this stone is the plumb-line stone, as he will yet interpret. It will be in Zerubbabel's hand when he begins to found the House, and this will be before Joshua. And so he interpreted the verse <b>the stone that I have set</b> — in Zerubbabel's hand before Joshua." "<b>And I will remove</b> — this word is among the verbs that go out like the word שב, which you find in two ways: שב is itself; also ושב after, like והשיב. And likewise: לא משו מקרב המחנה (they did not depart from the midst of the camp)." "<b>And I will remove the iniquity of the land</b> — and the meaning of iniquity is the punishment and the evil and the exile."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:45:53.961941169Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}